{{- define "attitude" -}}
{{if eq . "encouraged"}}We actively encourage contributions made with AI/LLM assistance.{{else if eq . "allowed"}}Contributions made with AI/LLM assistance are welcome.{{else if eq . "neutral"}}We have taken no position on AI/LLM-assisted contributions — if in doubt, ask first.{{else if eq . "discouraged"}}We discourage AI/LLM-assisted contributions, though we do not prohibit them.{{else if eq . "prohibited"}}We do not accept AI/LLM-assisted contributions.{{else}}Our stance on AI/LLM-assisted contributions is: {{.}}.{{end}}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "autonomy" -}}
{{if eq . "any"}}Autonomous agents may act on this project’s behalf, including opening pull requests and issues with no human in the loop.{{else if eq . "assisted"}}A human must drive, review, and submit every contribution — no autonomous agents.{{else if eq . "none"}}No LLM involvement is permitted anywhere in the contribution process.{{else}}Permitted autonomy: {{.}}.{{end}}
{{- end -}}

